<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Echoes of past in Australis-Optus link - ACCC.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Echoes of past in Australis-Optus link - ACCC.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian Competition and Consumer Commission (ACCC) chairman Allan Fels said on Wednesday that a planned joint venture between pay tv operators Australis Media Ltd and Optus Vision had some parallels with aspects of last year's failed Australis-Foxtel merger.</p>
<p>&quot;There are obviously some similarities with the Foxtel-Australis matter and there are some differences as well and we're engaged in the process of figuring out what they are,&quot; Fels told reporters after a Rotary function in Melbourne.</p>
</text>
